{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0146_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0146_story_05_title", "source_sha256": "ae3831778fbf8fa8209af45ecc8ca0ae6faf2f8aacb24a82c3d11819d471b247", "ja": "終宴♪　祭花火が咲いた後！", "zh": "散宴♪　祭典烟花绽放之后！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0146_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0146_story_05_synopsis", "source_sha256": "fc50d463225b5083dee6c26dda793829d606af2ee387c50e9b0d4fd8b48d537c", "ja": "ステージで全力を出し切ったアイドル達は、\n初めての生配信や、公演の感想を話し合う。\nのり子は、今までのことを振り返ると、\n照れくさそうにプロデューサーに\n感謝の言葉を伝えるのだった。", "zh": "在舞台上倾尽全力的偶像们，  \n互相聊起了第一次直播，以及对演出的感想。  \n回顾至今经历的一切，  \n害羞的诺莉子向制作人表达了感谢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0146_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0146_story_05_1000_p", "source_sha256": "43443046c80176722e88693a762062d3d13fcd52761c1711fde926ddf070f49e", "ja": "（閃光☆HANABI団のリバイバル公演が終了した。\n本当に、花火みたいに眩しいステージだったな……）", "zh": "（闪光☆HANABI团的复出演出结束了。\n真是一场如烟花般耀眼的舞台啊……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0146_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0146_story_05_1001_043nor", "source_sha256": "233fd84c4cb6c5ce321f3a635ce444affa458072c3107ed90c85d104e3f86268", "ja": "あー、楽しかった～！\nみんな、お疲れさま！", "zh": "啊～太开心啦～！\n大家，辛苦啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0146_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0146_story_05_1002_027say", "source_sha256": "9b9dd3d0b2f976a15980fdc62fb1d39c057a71b00260b8a8453f6c7dcc41dcc9", "ja": "熱い公演になりましたね……！\n私たちに今できること、全部やりきったと思います！", "zh": "这场演出真是太热烈了……！\n我觉得我们已经把现在能做的一切都做到最好了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0146_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0146_story_05_1003_029umi", "source_sha256": "aa0be58179992c63ffd336c685815fc4bce41100ceb077646a8615e28ec3dad9", "ja": "ほんと、楽しかったー！\n新しい衣装も、すっごくほめられたし……えへへ♪", "zh": "真的好开心——！\n新服装也得到了好多夸奖……嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0146_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0146_story_05_1004_019min", "source_sha256": "38e90a87ef0d60897856fac52ebc62fdf8e9281b7f1d5891687f4494f10c8b41", "ja": "{$P$}さんも、\n本当にお疲れさまでした♪", "zh": "{$P$}先生也真的辛苦了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0146_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0146_story_05_1005_p", "source_sha256": "3ff0fadb736d46ba83e7ca8a0820db9e1c0c6062b20378c7469295470bfe9527", "ja": "ああ、みんなもお疲れさま！\n公演も配信も、楽しかったみたいで良かったよ。", "zh": "啊，大家也辛苦了！\n演出和直播似乎都很开心，真是太好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0146_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0146_story_05_1006_037nao", "source_sha256": "da059b6214ccdba9f8d17b2f66b73d82074ac2901a1152385e47ab29890d2443", "ja": "それに関しては、私の構成台本のおかげやんな！　茜に\n無茶振りされた時はどないしようかと思ったけど……。", "zh": "这都多亏了我的演出脚本啦！被茜强人所难地安排时，我还在想该怎么办呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0146_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0146_story_05_1007_029umi", "source_sha256": "e86e8451503e2e0f5ec91f49cbb32aed6070f2f893d0781548e306b37dd4b33f", "ja": "そういえば、茜っちとロコロコが前にやってたよね。\nえっと、たしか……", "zh": "说起来，茜和ROCOROCO之前一起做过吧。呃，我记得是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0146_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0146_story_05_1008_019min", "source_sha256": "066f94293e6d6db214237f22ad7dba5cc8659e89caf2855077c96c00c8aa01ee", "ja": "『AKANE★CHANNEL』だっけ。その時の\n経験が活かせちゃうなんて、さすが奈緒ちゃんだね！", "zh": "是叫《AKANE★CHANNEL》来着吧。那时候的\n经验居然能派上用场，真不愧是奈绪呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0146_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0146_story_05_1009_037nao", "source_sha256": "69d47cca04608f72ca894948fb273013f19bc2d6d935a484c460f648c2b3e3fe", "ja": "ふっふっふ……美奈子、ええこと言うな♪\n{$P$}さんも、もっとほめてな～！", "zh": "呵呵呵……美奈子，说得好啊♪  \n{$P$}先生也要多夸夸我哦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0146_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0146_story_05_1010_p", "source_sha256": "7a2a8a1281ae5f9d227280346d8a4c6985df2b83bc594259af0f00448d44d0f0", "ja": "はは、そうだな！　……お、もうこんな時間だ。\nみんな、早く着替えてくるといい。", "zh": "哈哈，说得没错！……哦，已经这么晚了。\n大家快去换衣服吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0146_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0146_story_05_1011_027say", "source_sha256": "77b9d735877e3d66bf0c4d42c15bc23bab63e10b2c755fc45e828475b13f98e6", "ja": "あっ、そうですね！\n行こう、みんな！", "zh": "啊，对哦！\n走吧，大家！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0146_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0146_story_05_1013_p", "source_sha256": "da2748b5b18186f2b4ec4aa27561966670d96bdb120fdb56c0f40910af15de24", "ja": "のり子？　どうしたんだ、行かないのか？", "zh": "诺莉子？怎么了，不走吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0146_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0146_story_05_1014_043nor", "source_sha256": "dc7c6df42479e062adedef699b2e6f028509db28d74cb6175ff3286737b208e0", "ja": "あ、うん。行くけど……\nえっと、{$P$}。ありがとね！", "zh": "啊，嗯。要去是要去……\n那个，{$P$}。谢谢你！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0146_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0146_story_05_1015_p", "source_sha256": "f85e9ef96512a4ec8260acfbd3b22d28c14c5548e1b7d61a7a4754db36dbf5b1", "ja": "え？　どうしたんだ、急に。", "zh": "咦？怎么了，突然这样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0146_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0146_story_05_1016_043nor", "source_sha256": "029ff4919e65e18fac87514825b4b267ce48ab1c3cab23980c68eb4d3515438f", "ja": "ほら、アタシはもう高校生じゃないでしょ？　だから\nみんなともう1回高校生やれて、楽しかったんだ！", "zh": "你看，我已经不是高中生了吧？所以能和大家再当1次高中生，真的很开心！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0146_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0146_story_05_1017_043nor", "source_sha256": "d6ff983af10fe293fd7025fc5ee3a059f721d3149cf7357ffdd6ef92bd64f8c5", "ja": "ドラマの役も、モテモテとか……ちょっと照れたけど、\nすごく面白かったし。いい経験になったなーって。", "zh": "电视剧里的角色也是，像是很受欢迎什么的……虽然让我有点害羞，但真的很有意思。感觉是一次很棒的经历呢——", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0146_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0146_story_05_1018_043nor", "source_sha256": "842027e48439a2de8778890b05cf6d0c598f22cada6493097d2e9e18a41f1db4", "ja": "アタシ、閃光☆HANABI団のメンバーでよかった！\n……それだけ！　んじゃ着替えてくるね♪", "zh": "我能成为闪耀☆HANABI团的成员，真是太好了！\n……就这些！那我去换衣服啦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0146_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0146_story_05_1019_p", "source_sha256": "e0c7a85daa33d5fb56e42a099819393f55a5188e100975ba2edf191b287a8dd3", "ja": "（のり子は照れくさそうにそう言うと、駆けていった。\nユニットでの経験は、きっと次の輝きを生むだろう）", "zh": "（法子害羞地说完这句话，便跑开了。\n在组合中的经历，一定会孕育出下一道光芒。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0146_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0146_story_05_1020_p", "source_sha256": "e6460cd1b8fd668a58b0d6abc8b82da3156eac9aca18d00c629213333fc24821", "ja": "（公演が終わっても、閃光☆HANABI団だけが持つ\n魅力の花火は、何度だって打ち上がるはずだ……！）", "zh": "（就算公演结束了，只有闪光☆HANABI团才拥有的魅力烟花，也一定会无数次绽放……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
